minaret:DuaOccurrence_TQ2005-0319_0001_2215_72_Healing-04 a minaret:DuaOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2286.92 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "«بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِیْمِ ۟ اَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعٰلَمِیْنَ ۟ۙ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِیْمِ ۟ۙ مٰلِكِ یَوْمِ الدِّیْنِ ۟ؕ اِیَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَاِیَّاكَ نَسْتَعِیْنُ ۟ؕ اِهْدِنَا الصِّرَاطَ الْمُسْتَقِیْمَ ۟ۙ صِرَاطَ الَّذِیْنَ اَنْعَمْتَ عَلَیْهِمْ ۙ۬ غَیْرِ الْمَغْضُوْبِ عَلَیْهِمْ وَلَا الضَّآلِّیْنَ»" ;
    minaret:hasExtentType minaret:CompleteCitation ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_TQ2005-0319_2215_72_2286_92 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Dua_Healing-04 ;
    minaret:startTime 2215.72 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0000_422_0_SB_1773 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 435.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "The performance of Umrah is an expiation for the sins committed between one Umrah and the next, and the reward of Hajj Mabroor is nothing except Jannah" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_422_0_435_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1773 ;
    minaret:startTime 422.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0001_612_0_SN_3140 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 625.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "A man came to Rasulullah and said: 'What do you think of a man who fights seeking reward and fame, what will he have?' Rasulullah said: 'He will not have anything.'" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_612_0_625_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SN_3140 ;
    minaret:startTime 612.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0002_1449_0_SB_6307 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1456.76 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah, he also would ask Allah to forgive him 70 to 100 times a day" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Paraphrase ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_1449_0_1456_76 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_6307 ;
    minaret:startTime 1449.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0003_2972_0_SM_1337 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2977.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "قَدْ فَرَضَ اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكُمُ الْحَجَّ فَحُجُّوا" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_2972_0_2977_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_1337 ;
    minaret:startTime 2972.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0004_2956_0_SM_1337 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2962.18 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "O people, Allah has made Hajj an obligation for you, so perform Hajj" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_2956_0_2962_18 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_1337 ;
    minaret:startTime 2956.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0005_3028_0_AD_1721 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3048.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Ibn Abbas said that he asked Rasulullah: 'Ya Rasulullah, Hajj is to be performed annually or only once?' Rasulullah said: 'Only once, and if anyone performs it more often, he performs a nafl'" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_3028_0_3048_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_1721 ;
    minaret:startTime 3028.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0006_3079_26_Ahmad_2867 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3082.44 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "تَعَجَّلُوا إِلَى الْحَجِّ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_3079_26_3082_44 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_Ahmad_2867 ;
    minaret:startTime 3079.26 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0007_3082_44_Ahmad_2867 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3089.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Hasten to do Hajj, for no one of you knows what will happen to him" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_3082_44_3089_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_Ahmad_2867 ;
    minaret:startTime 3082.44 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0008_3113_0_AD_1732 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3123.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Whoever intends to perform Hajj, let him hasten to do so, for he may fall sick, lose his mount, or be faced with some need." ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_3113_0_3123_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_1732 ;
    minaret:startTime 3113.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0009_3138_3_JT_810 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3147.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "when we perform Hajj and Umrah, then what happens? We don't become poor, that's a Hadith" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Paraphrase ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_3138_3_3147_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_810 ;
    minaret:startTime 3138.3 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7038_0010_3159_0_AD_1798 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3205.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "I came to Umar and said to him: I was a Christian Bedouin and I have embraced Islam. I am eager to do jihad, and I found that both Hajj and Umrah were due from me... Umar said: 'You have been guided to the practice of your Prophet.'" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7038_3159_0_3205_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_1798 ;
    minaret:startTime 3159.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7039_0000_767_7199999999999_SM_520 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 790.24 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah was asked about the masjid which was first set up on the earth. He responded: It was Al-Masjid al-Haram, then Al-Masjid al-Aqsa" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7039_767_7199999999999_790_24 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_520 ;
    minaret:startTime 767.7199999999999 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7039_0001_1014_34_IbnMajah_2898 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1029.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Perform Hajj and Umrah one after the other, for performing them one after the other removes poverty and sin as the bellows removes impurity from iron" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7039_1014_34_1029_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_IbnMajah_2898 ;
    minaret:startTime 1014.34 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7039_0002_2085_72_SM_1337 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2095.04 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "O people, Allah has made Hajj an obligation for you, so perform Hajj" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7039_2085_72_2095_04 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_1337 ;
    minaret:startTime 2085.72 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7039_0003_3241_9_SM_1348 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3252.26 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Jihad of the elderly, the young, the weak, and woman is Hajj and Umrah" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7039_3241_9_3252_26 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_1348 ;
    minaret:startTime 3241.9 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0000_491_42_SB_3364 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 560.84 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "May Allah bestow mercy on Ismail's mother. Had she let the Zamzam flow without trying to control it, Zamzam would have been a stream flowing on the surface of the earth..." ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_491_42_560_84 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_3364 ;
    minaret:startTime 491.42 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0001_780_68_JT_960 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 790.64 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Tawaf is like Salah the only difference is that during Tawaf you can talk" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_780_68_790_64 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_960 ;
    minaret:startTime 780.68 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0002_1363_55_SB_1865 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1396.09 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah saw an old man walking supported by his two sons... Allah is not in need of this old man's torturing himself, and then he ordered him to ride" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_1363_55_1396_09 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1865 ;
    minaret:startTime 1363.55 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0003_1442_61_SB_2860 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1492.01 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "A horse may be kept for one of three reasons: for a man it may be a source of reward... whatever its rope allows it to eat will be regarded as a good rewardable deed... even its dung will be considered amongst his good deeds..." ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_1442_61_1492_01 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_2860 ;
    minaret:startTime 1442.61 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0004_3050_77_SB_1562 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3067.29 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Aisha said: We set out with Allah's Messenger in the months of Hajj, and in the nights of Hajj, and at the time and places of Hajj, and in a state of Hajj" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_3050_77_3067_29 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1562 ;
    minaret:startTime 3050.77 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0005_3068_21_SB_1545 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3129.27 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah with his Sahaba they started from Medina for Makkah... while in Dhul Hulaifah... on the 25th of Dhu al-Qa'dah and when he reached Makkah it was the 4th of Dhu al-Hijjah" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_3068_21_3129_27 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1545 ;
    minaret:startTime 3068.21 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0006_3262_93_SB_5089 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3267.11 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اَللّٰهُمَّ مَحِلِّيْ حَیْثُ حَبَسْتَنِیْ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_3262_93_3267_11 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_5089 ;
    minaret:startTime 3262.93 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0007_3267_11_SB_5089 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3276.41 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "O Allah, I will exit ihram wherever You stop me" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_3267_11_3276_41 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_5089 ;
    minaret:startTime 3267.11 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7040_0008_3392_29_SB_1564 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3421.83 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah performed Hajj and Umrah together, so it was Qiran. But Rasulullah, he wished for Tamattu'. He said: 'And if I were to know my affair before what I had to do, I would not have brought with me the sacrificial animals...'" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7040_3392_29_3421_83 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1564 ;
    minaret:startTime 3392.29 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0000_407_28_SM_1297 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 440.2 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "خُذُوا عَنِّي مَنَاسِكَكُمْ — Jabir reported: I saw Rasulullah flinging pebbles while riding his camel on the day of Nahr, saying: Learn your rituals from me, for I do not know whether I would be performing Hajj after this Hajj of mine" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_407_28_440_2 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_1297 ;
    minaret:startTime 407.28 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0001_467_62_AD_1919 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 507.52 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Yazid bin Shaiban said: We were standing in Arafat in a place far from the place of standing... Ibn Mirba' al-Ansari came and said: I am the messenger of Rasulullah... Stay where you are for it is a place of ritual, for you are following the legacy of your father Ibrahim" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_467_62_507_52 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_1919 ;
    minaret:startTime 467.62 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0002_747_46_IbnMajah_2890 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 776.16 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah performed Hajj on an old saddle, wearing a cloak that was worth only four dirhams or less. Then he said: Allahumma hijjatun la riya'a fiha wala sum'ah — O Allah, a Hajj in which there is no showing off nor reputation sought" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_747_46_776_16 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_IbnMajah_2890 ;
    minaret:startTime 747.46 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0003_1049_34_AD_1862 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1079.72 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah said: If anyone breaks a bone or leg or becomes lame, he has come out of ihram and must perform Hajj the following year" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1049_34_1079_72 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_1862 ;
    minaret:startTime 1049.34 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0004_1238_62_SM_1963 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1257.94 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah said: Sacrifice only a grown-up animal unless it is difficult for you, in which case sacrifice a ram of more than six months of age" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1238_62_1257_94 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_1963 ;
    minaret:startTime 1238.62 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0005_1283_68_SB_2731 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1333.98 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "When Rasulullah made a peace deal with Quraysh... Um Salamah gave advice: Go out and do not say a word to anyone until you sacrifice your camel and call your barber to shave your head. When he did that, the Sahaba got up and offered their sacrifices" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1283_68_1333_98 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_2731 ;
    minaret:startTime 1283.68 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0006_1358_82_SB_1806 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1378.62 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Abdullah bin Umar set out for Makkah intending to perform Umrah during the time of fitnah... and said: If I should be prevented from reaching the Kaaba, I would do the same as Rasulullah did in the year of Hudaybiyyah" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1358_82_1378_62 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1806 ;
    minaret:startTime 1358.82 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0007_1504_22_SB_1560 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1534.58 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Hafsa said: Ya Rasulullah, why have the people finished their Ihram after performing Umrah but you have not? He replied: I have matted my hair and garlanded my hady, so I will not finish my Ihram till I have slaughtered my animal" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1504_22_1534_58 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1560 ;
    minaret:startTime 1504.22 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0008_1615_82_SB_1571 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1640.6 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Imran bin Husayn said: The verse of Tamattu' was revealed in Allah's Book, so we performed it with Rasulullah, and nothing was revealed in the Quran to make it illegal nor did Rasulullah prohibit it till he died" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1615_82_1640_6 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1571 ;
    minaret:startTime 1615.82 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0009_1681_24_SB_1736 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1726.3 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Rasulullah stopped near Jamarat at Mina... A man said: I forgot and got my head shaved before slaughtering. He said: There is no harm, go and slaughter now... Whenever he was asked about anything performed before or after, his reply was: Do it now, there is no harm" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_1681_24_1726_3 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1736 ;
    minaret:startTime 1681.24 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0010_2041_2_SB_1814 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2067.64 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Ka'b bin Ujrah reported that Rasulullah said to him regarding his head lice: Have your head shaved, then either fast three days, or feed six poor persons, or slaughter one sheep as a sacrifice" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_2041_2_2067_64 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1814 ;
    minaret:startTime 2041.2 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0011_2310_48_SB_1997 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2350.22 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Aisha and Ibn Umar said: Nobody was allowed to fast on the days of Tashreeq except those who could not afford the sacrificial animal" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_2310_48_2350_22 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1997 ;
    minaret:startTime 2310.48 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0012_2384_98_SB_1998 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2515.58 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Ibn Umar said: During the Farewell Hajj, Rasulullah performed Umrah and Hajj and drove a hady... Whoever has driven the sacrificial animal should not finish their Ihram till he completes his Hajj, and whoever has not should do Tawaf, Sa'ee, cut hair, and finish Ihram" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_2384_98_2515_58 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1998 ;
    minaret:startTime 2384.98 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0013_2798_42_SB_1521 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2808.18 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Whoever performs Hajj to this House and does not commit any obscenity nor any sin will come out as sinless as a newborn child" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_2798_42_2808_18 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1521 ;
    minaret:startTime 2798.42 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0014_2964_78_SB_1773 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2974.6 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "The reward of Hajj Mabroor is nothing except Jannah" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_2964_78_2974_6 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_1773 ;
    minaret:startTime 2964.78 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0015_3107_58_JT_1956 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 3136.06 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Your smile for your brother is charity, commanding good and forbidding evil is charity, giving directions to a person who is lost is charity, guiding a man with bad sight is charity, and removing a stone, thorn, or bone from the path is charity" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_3107_58_3136_06 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_1956 ;
    minaret:startTime 3107.58 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0000_81_6_JT_2382 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 677.32 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "لَاُحَدِّثَنَّكَ حَدِیْثًا حَدَّثَنِیْهِ رَسُوْلُ اللّٰهِ صَلَّی اللّٰهُ عَلَیْهِ وَسَلَّمَ... اَنَّ اللّٰهَ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالٰی اِذَا كَانَ یَوْمُ الْقِیٰمَةِ یَنْزِلُ اِلَی الْعِبَادِ لِیَقْضِیَ بَیْنَهُمْ... فَاَوَّلُ مَنْ یُّدْعٰی بِهٖ رَجُلٌ جَمَعَ الْقُرْاٰنَ... وَرَجُلٌ كَثِیْرُ الْمَالِ... وَیُؤْتٰی بِالَّذِیْ قُتِلَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِ اللّٰهِ... اُولٰٓئِكَ الثَّلٰثَةُ اَوَّلُ خَلْقِ اللّٰهِ تُسَعَّرُ بِهِمُ النَّارُ یَوْمَ الْقِیٰمَةِ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_81_6_677_32 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_2382 ;
    minaret:startTime 81.6 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0001_331_0_JT_2382 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 677.32 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "مجھ سے رسول اللہ صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم نے حدیث بیان کی کہ بے شک اللہ تبارک و تعالیٰ جب قیامت کا دن ہوگا نازل ہوگا بندوں کی طرف... تو پہلا شخص جسے پکارا جائے گا وہ شخص ہوگا جس نے قرآن جمع کیا... اور وہ شخص جس کے پاس بہت مال تھا... پھر لایا جائے گا وہ شخص جو اللہ کی راہ میں مارا گیا... یہ تین لوگ ہوں گے اللہ کی مخلوق میں سے پہلے جن کے ذریعے جہنم کی آگ قیامت کے دن بھڑکائی جائے گی۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_331_0_677_32 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_2382 ;
    minaret:startTime 331.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0002_772_34_AD_1047 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 783.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اور اس دن میں بہترین نفلی عبادت درود شریف کا کثرت سے پڑھنا ہے کیونکہ آپ صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم نے اس دن درود شریف پڑھنے کے لیے خود کہا ہے۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Paraphrase ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_772_34_783_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_1047 ;
    minaret:startTime 772.34 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0003_1123_76_SM_746 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1126.8 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "كَانَ خُلُقُهُ الْقُرْاٰنَ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_1123_76_1126_8 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_746 ;
    minaret:startTime 1123.76 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0004_1126_8_SM_746 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1133.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "وہ قرآن ہی تھا۔ گویا آپ کی عملی زندگی کیا تھی؟ قرآن کا چلتا پھرتا نمونہ۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_1126_8_1133_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_746 ;
    minaret:startTime 1126.8 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0005_1686_0_AD_3646 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1699.18 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "خدا کی قسم جس کے قبضے میں میری جان ہے میری زبان سے حق کے سوا کچھ نہیں نکلتا، خواہ میں غصے میں ہوں، خواہ میں دوسری حالت میں ہوں لیکن اس زبان سے جو کچھ نکلتا ہے وہ درست نکلتا ہے، اور آپ نے ان کو لکھنے کی اجازت دی۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_1686_0_1699_18 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_3646 ;
    minaret:startTime 1686.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0006_2109_6_AD_3641 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2117.22 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "پیغمبر مال تو نہیں چھوڑ کے جاتے، پیغمبر تو علم چھوڑ کے جاتے ہیں، اور جس نے اس علم کا حصہ پا لیا اس نے آپ کی وراثت کا حصہ پا لیا۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_2109_6_2117_22 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_3641 ;
    minaret:startTime 2109.6 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0007_2699_8_Ahmad_24392 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2704.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اَللّٰهُمَّ حَسَّنْتَ خَلْقِیْ فَاَحْسِنْ خُلُقِیْ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_2699_8_2704_5 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_Ahmad_24392 ;
    minaret:startTime 2699.8 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0008_2704_8_Ahmad_24392 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2715.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اے اللہ تو نے میری صورت اچھی بنائی، تو نے میری شکل و صورت خوبصورت بنائی، تو میرے اخلاق کو بھی اچھا کر دے۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_2704_8_2715_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_Ahmad_24392 ;
    minaret:startTime 2704.8 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21590_0009_2881_0_SB_13 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2897.56 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "خدا کی قسم کوئی شخص اس وقت تک مومن نہیں ہو سکتا جب تک کہ وہ دوسرے کے لیے وہ نہ چاہے جو وہ اپنے لیے چاہتا ہے۔" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21590_2881_0_2897_56 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SB_13 ;
    minaret:startTime 2881.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0000_1152_0_Ahmad_8952 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1157.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اِنَّمَا بُعِثْتُ لِاُتَمِّمَ صَالِحَ الْاَخْلَاقِ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_1152_0_1157_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_Ahmad_8952 ;
    minaret:startTime 1152.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0001_1164_0_Ahmad_8952 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 1169.7 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "بے شک میں اچھے اخلاق کی تکمیل کے لیے بھیجا گیا ہوں" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_1164_0_1169_7 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_Ahmad_8952 ;
    minaret:startTime 1164.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0002_2281_0_SM_2310 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2286.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "كَانَ رَسُوْلُ اللّٰهِ صَلَّی اللّٰهُ عَلَیْهِ وَسَلَّمَ اَحْسَنَ النَّاسِ خُلُقًا" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2281_0_2286_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_2310 ;
    minaret:startTime 2281.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0003_2292_0_SM_2310 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2297.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "رسول اللہ صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم لوگوں میں سب سے زیادہ اچھے اخلاق کے مالک تھے" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2292_0_2297_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_SM_2310 ;
    minaret:startTime 2292.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0004_2313_0_AD_4682 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2317.0 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اَكْمَلُ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ اِیْمَانًا اَحْسَنُهُمْ خُلُقًا" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2313_0_2317_0 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_4682 ;
    minaret:startTime 2313.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0005_2331_0_AD_4682 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2348.3 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "سب سے زیادہ کامل سب سے زیادہ مکمل ایمان میں کون ہے جو سب سے اچھے ہیں اخلاق میں" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2331_0_2348_3 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_AD_4682 ;
    minaret:startTime 2331.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0006_2367_0_JT_2003 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2382.06 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "مَا مِنْ شَیْءٍ یُّوْضَعُ فِی الْمِیْزَانِ اَثْقَلُ مِنْ حُسْنِ الْخُلُقِ وَاِنَّ صَاحِبَ حُسْنِ الْخُلُقِ لَیَبْلُغُ بِهٖ دَرَجَةَ صَاحِبِ الصَّوْمِ وَالصَّلٰوةِ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2367_0_2382_06 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_2003 ;
    minaret:startTime 2367.0 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0007_2450_44_JT_2003 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2493.18 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "میزان میں جو نیکی سب سے زیادہ وزنی ہوگی وہ حسن اخلاق ہوگا... اور اچھے اخلاق کے ذریعے پہنچ جاتا ہے ایک انسان روزے اور نماز والے کے درجے کو" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2450_44_2493_18 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:Hadith_JT_2003 ;
    minaret:startTime 2450.44 .

minaret:HadithOccurrence_HUSN_AKHL-21591_0008_2536_3_JT_2684 a minaret:HadithOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 2544.5 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "خَصْلَتَانِ لَا تَجْتَمِعَانِ فِیْ مُنَافِقٍ: حُسْنُ سَمْتٍ وَّلَا فِقْهٌ فِی الدِّیْنِ" ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HUSN_AKHL-21591_2536_3_2544_5 ;
