    minaret:sequenceIndex 232 ;
    minaret:startTime 2365.16 ;
    minaret:text "who is included in that seven fast after a person reaches home a person who actually goes back home so let's say there are some people they are from makkah right they are from haram area" .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7041_0233 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 2384.98 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7041_0234 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 233 ;
    minaret:startTime 2374.96 ;
    minaret:text "they don't go back home right that's their home haram boundaries their home then it doesn't apply to them so let's learn ibn umar he said" .

